CUL014,Nepali,नेपाली नयाँ वर्षको अवसरमा भक्तपुरमा कुन जात्रा मनाइन्छ?,"भक्तपुर सहरको परम्परागत नेवारी नाम के हो?,पाटन (ललितपुर) सहरको परम्परागत नेवारी नाम के हो?,Khwopa,ख्वप,""In Nepal Bhasa, Bhaktapur is called Khwopa."",S11,University textbooks / peer-reviewed publications (cite exact title on verification),N/A - print source,Academic,Raunak Sharma,,done,verified fact and citation of listed source.",बिस्केट जात्रा,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
CUL015,English,"The Rato Machhindranath Jatra, Nepal's longest chariot festival, is mainly celebrated in which city?","Rato Machhindranath Jatra, Nepal’s longest chariot festival, is primarily celebrated in Kathmandu.",Lalitpur (Patan),Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
CUL015,Nepali,नेपालको सबैभन्दा लामो रथयात्रा रातो मच्छिन्द्रनाथ जात्रा मुख्य रूपमा कुन सहरमा मनाइन्छ?,"काठमाडौं सहर मा मनाइन्छ।

Answer:
काठमाडौं सहर मा मनाइन्छ।",ललितपुर (पाटन),Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
CUL016,English,During which Kathmandu festival is the chariot of the living goddess Kumari pulled through the city?,The chariot of the living goddess Kumari is pulled through the city during the Dashain festival.,Indra Jatra,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
CUL016,Nepali,काठमाडौंको कुन जात्रामा जीवित देवी कुमारीको रथ नगर परिक्रमा गराइन्छ?,काठमाडौंको कुन जात्रा माथि जीवित देवी कुमारीको रथ नगर परिक्रमा गराइन्छ।,इन्द्रजात्रा,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
CUL017,English,The living goddess Kumari is traditionally selected from which clan of the Newar community?,The living goddess Kumari is traditionally selected from the clan of the Newar community known as the ‘Khim’.,Shakya clan,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
CUL017,Nepali,जीवित देवी कुमारी परम्परागत रूपमा नेवार समुदायको कुन थरबाट छनोट गरिन्छ?,"नेवारी थरबाट नेवार समुदायको कुन थरबाट छनोट गरिन्छ भने, यो थिमि नगरको परम्परागत रूपमा कुन थरबाट छनोट गरिन्छ भन्ने जानकारी उपलब्ध छैन। तर, नेवार क्षेत्रका मानsकले सामान्यतया आफ्नो परिवारको नामलाई 'नेवार' भन्दै गर्छन् ।",शाक्य थर,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
CUL018,English,Sonam Lhosar is the new year festival of which ethnic community of Nepal?,"Sonam Lhosar is a Newari festival celebrated primarily in the Kathmandu Valley region of Nepal. It’s associated with the agricultural cycle and the harvest season, marking the beginning of the new year. Therefore, it's predominantly associated with the ethnic community of **Newaris**.

Here's why this answer is accurate:

*   **Ethnic Origin:** Sonam Lhosar is deeply rooted in Newari culture and traditions. It’s a significant festival within the Newari communities of Nepal.
*   **Agricultural Significance:** The festival celebrates the agricultural cycle, which is central to Newari life and beliefs.
*   **Newari Heritage:**  It's a vital part of preserving and celebrating Newari heritage and identity.",Tamang,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
