CUL085,English,"In Nepali Hindu tradition, vermilion powder (sindoor) in the hair parting signifies what status of a woman?","Vermilion powder (sindoor) in the hair parting signifies respect, prosperity, and marital status for a woman in Nepali Hinduism. It’s considered an auspicious color and is used to signify her marital status and social standing. The specific shade and placement can vary depending on the region and occasion.",Married status,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
